--- !u!114 &802150162
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 802150158}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 24feb1ea25740a04fa41f42ad2956c32, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  interactionText: "At the bottom of the book cabinet, something is carefully tucked
    away \u2014 a hidden compartment. Inside, a diary.[next]\nThe page reads:[next]\nI
    get it \u2014 Wally\u2019s trying to be the big, tough brother, trying to keep
    things under control and all... but it just feels wrong.[next]\nHe won\u2019t
    even let Ed leave the house \u2014 not even to attend Mom\u2019s death anniversary.
    After he caught him on the way to the cemetery, he just... locked him in the
    basement.[next]Everyone keeps saying Ed started that fire... but what if he didn\u2019t?
    [next]What if someone else burned our house down? [next]What if it was all just
    a horrible accident? [next]What if the police \u2014 and Dad, and Wally \u2014
    are all wrong?[next]\nThey didn\u2019t even have enough evidence. But somehow
    that doesn\u2019t matter anymore.[next] I just don\u2019t get it. Why are we
    so quick to turn on each other? He\u2019s our family. We already lost Mom...
    isn\u2019t that enough?"
  dialogBox: {fileID: 276245986}
  dialogText: {fileID: 1066936183}
